{"id":"n58953-1-8","stage":5,"title":"별안간 · 一眨眼工夫","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58953-1-8-1","ko":"왜 옷이 흠뻑 젖었니?","zh":"怎么衣服湿透了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"옷이","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷이","audio":"/audio/4ed934dde6defcc6f810.mp3"}},{"text":"흠뻑","meaning":"湿透地","explanation":"흠뻑：湿透地","readings":[{"term":"흠뻑","audio":"/audio/8028484af6806f133bcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87477","senseId":"2","lemma":"흠뻑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흠뻑","audio":"/audio/8028484af6806f133bcb.mp3"}},{"text":"젖었니?","meaning":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","explanation":"젖다：沾湿，浸湿，润湿；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"젖다","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64729","senseId":"1","lemma":"젖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젖었니","audio":"/audio/8d81cb4255fd9a19591e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"8028484af6806f13","term":"흠뻑","zh":"湿透地","audio":"/audio/8028484af6806f133bcb.mp3","entryId":"87477","definition":"淋湿到水往外流出来的程度。","pronunciation":["흠뻑"]},{"id":"5f61a84f921197b6","term":"젖다",